<header class="page-hero">
  <h1>Three devices, open firmware, no subscription.</h1>
  <p class="page-hero-subtitle">Choose a Go on a LilyGO T-Echo, or a Go+ on a T-Echo Plus, to broadcast your position in ADS-L and receive ADS-L and FLARM traffic. Bravo runs on a MeshTracker X1 and receives other aircraft fitted with ADS-B. It works with your Go or on its own with your navigation app. Buy the hardware and install the free skyBlip firmware by USB. The X1 ships with Meshtastic, which receives no ADS-B.</p>
</header>

